@base = http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1
@origin = http://127.0.0.1:8000

### 1. Сессия. HTTP-клиент сохраняет cookie.
POST {{base}}/session
Origin: {{origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 2. Новая задача — новый UUID. Повтор той же задачи — тот же UUID.
# @name create
POST {{base}}/searches
Origin: {{origin}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 233bca3b-bd46-4bfd-af64-66ee99547f31

{"query":"Рим на два дня, прогулки и культура","params":{"destination":"Рим","duration_days":2}}

### 3. Snapshot
GET {{base}}/searches/{{create.response.body.$.search_id}}

### 4. Итог через SSE
GET {{base}}/searches/{{create.response.body.$.search_id}}/events

### 5. Trip
GET {{base}}/trips/{{create.response.body.$.trip_id}}

### 6. Save
# @name save
PUT {{base}}/trips/{{create.response.body.$.trip_id}}/saved
Origin: {{origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 7. My Trips
GET {{base}}/trips?saved=true

### 8. Schedule. При повторе получить актуальную revision поездки.
PUT {{base}}/trips/{{create.response.body.$.trip_id}}/schedule
Origin: {{origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"expected_revision":{{save.response.body.$.revision}},"start_date":"2026-11-10","end_date":"2026-11-11","timezone":"Europe/Rome"}

### 9. Календарный диапазон
GET {{base}}/trips?from=2026-11-01&to=2026-11-30
